  data: {
    LLM: "Testing Hypotheses: Don't just play what you think is legal. Occasionally play a card you suspect is UNLAWFUL to confirm the boundaries of the rule.\n\nThe False Scent: If you are God, design a rule that initially looks like color alternation but is actually based on rank. This delays discovery and increases your score.\n\nProphecy Timing: Become the Prophet as soon as you are 90% sure. Waiting too long allows other players to dump more cards, reducing your lead.",
